      "alt\tZoë's Kitchen restaurant exterior, an Espada-managed property": 1,
      "copy\tEach member of our team has a solid background in property management and a deep knowledge of the market. We are prepared to address every phase of your project including tenant relations, physical inspections, accounting, annual budgets, advertising and negotiating with outside vendors. We have built strong service relationships necessary to ensure your project consistently appears its best. Espada is prepared to manage all tasks including any capital improvement projects necessary to enhance its value.": 1,
      "copy\tEspada Property Management will deliver innovative ideas and responsive solutions supported by expert analyses and clear, in-depth reporting. Our proven methodology applies client-specific accounting systems to reduce operating expenses and increase cash flow. Monthly or quarterly reports will be prepared allowing our clients to make the best decisions regarding the asset.": 1,
